    },
    {
      "id": "NZztx",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "LUWR5",
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math> which satisfies equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math>.</p><p>So, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
